gh support in  congress  and also on the streets where he has led  three motorbike rallies  but the president's popularity has taken  a severe blow  his approval rate has fallen to a record  23 percent  putting at risk bolsonaro's hope of  being re-elected next year  monika al jazeera rio de janeiro
 

